        "value": 19
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>The Mk.IV is the last and rarest Atlas, built in small numbers for Cerberus' elite formations. Every system is pushed to its limit; a single Mk.IV can hold a position against a full squad. If the cockpit is penetrated, the pilot is exposed and may continue fighting on foot.</p><p><strong>Construct Immunities:</strong> Immune to disease, mental effects, poison, sleep, and paralysis.</p>",
